    "number": "O7R12",
    "title": "Procedure on rejecting plaint.",
    "content": "Where a plaint is rejected the Judge shall record an order to that effect with the reasons for such order.\n",
    "html": "<article class=\"provision\" data-n=\"O7R12\" data-report=\"Order 7, Rule 12 · The Code of Civil Procedure, 1908\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"prov-head\"><h3 class=\"prov-title\"><span class=\"n\">12</span>Procedure on rejecting plaint.</h3></div><p class=\"prov-cite\">Order 7, Rule 12</p><div class=\"prov-body\"><p>Where a plaint is rejected the Judge shall record an order to that effect with the reasons for such order.</p></div></article>",
    "inner_html": "<div class=\"prov-head\"><h3 class=\"prov-title\"><span class=\"n\">12</span>Procedure on rejecting plaint.</h3></div><p class=\"prov-cite\">Order 7, Rule 12</p><div class=\"prov-body\"><p>Where a plaint is rejected the Judge shall record an order to that effect with the reasons for such order.</p></div>"
